   "axis": "combat",
   "vs_three": "With Ramses on the battlefield, any opponent who loses after an Assassin attacked them that turn makes me win the game, so ONE elimination ends all three opponents (attack every opponent with at least one Assassin on the kill turn): Ezio connects with a player at 10 or less and {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} removes them; Magister Sphinx sets a player to 10, Unstoppable Slasher halves a player's life in the same combat (its trigger resolves before Ezio's check), team damage does the rest. Without Ramses each elimination removes one player and the route repeats. Ramses is found by Diabolic Tutor and Adewale and returned by Entomb plus Restart Sequence, Layla, Jacob or Altair."
  },
  "Assassin team beatdown": {
   "cards": [
    "Arno Dorian",
    "Bayek of Siwa",
    "Rally the Peasants"
   ],
   "axis": "combat",
   "vs_three": "Five or six evasive Assassins split their attacks over the three opponents every turn; Arno adds +2/+0 to every other Assassin, Bayek gives the legendary attackers double strike on my turn, and Rally the Peasants adds +2/+0 to the whole team at instant speed, twice with flashback: each resolution raises the damage to every opponent at once."
  },
